Fonts

AdminCraft contains no font files of its own. The interface uses the fonts egui ships through
epaint_default_fonts: Ubuntu Light (Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0), Hack (MIT License and Bitstream
Vera License), Noto Emoji (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and the emoji-icon-font subset (MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2014 John Slegers). Their license texts are distributed with that crate:
https://github.com/emilk/egui/tree/main/crates/epaint_default_fonts/fonts

Root certificates

The list of trusted certificate authorities comes from the webpki-roots crate (Mozilla's root
program), under the Community Data License Agreement - Permissive, Version 2.0.

Other programs

PuTTY, OpenSSH, mstsc, FreeRDP, Remmina, VNC viewers and KeePass are not part of AdminCraft. It
only starts the copies installed on the computer or placed in the AdminCraftTools folder by the
person using it. mRemoteNG, PuTTY, KeePass, Angry IP Scanner and other names are mentioned only
to describe compatibility; they belong to their owners.
